  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Democratic Resilience &amp; Human Rights Through Media in NGA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will fortify democratic resilience and human rights protection in Nigeria by enhancing electoral integrity, accountability journalism, press freedom and citizen access to reliable information, especially during elctions and in conflict-affected areas. Focusing on selected states with national reach, the project will empower independent media to produce public-interest reporting that drives transparency and  civic participation. Special emphasis will be placed on Plateau and Benue states - hotspots for conflict and identity-based violence - where local journalists will receive training and mentorship to document failures and rights abuses through human-centered story telling.</narrative>
  </description>
